questions.q:
Frequency of the de-Broglie wave of electron in Bohr's first orbit of hydrogen atom is _______ \(\times 10^{13} \mathrm{~Hz}\) (nearest integer).
\(\begin{aligned}
& \text { [Given : } \mathrm{R}_{\mathrm{H}}(\text { Rydberg constant })=2.18 \times 10^{-18} \mathrm{~J}, h \text { (Plank's } \\
& \text { constant })=6.6 \times 10^{-34} \mathrm{~J} \text {.s.] }
\end{aligned}\)

